WEBVTT

00:21.250 --> 00:22.750
(Ryeo Un)

00:23.980 --> 00:25.980
(Choi Hyun Wook)

00:27.990 --> 00:29.650
(Seol In Ah)

00:34.529 --> 00:36.459
(Shin Eun Soo)

00:44.170 --> 00:48.068
(Twinkling Watermelon)

00:48.069 --> 00:49.568
(Production sponsors)

00:49.569 --> 00:51.038
(Ministry of Culture, Sports and Tourism, KOCCA)

00:51.039 --> 00:52.078
(All people, organizations, locations, and incidents...)

00:52.079 --> 00:53.138
(in this drama are fictitious.)

00:53.139 --> 00:54.139
(Staff ensured child actors' safety in the filming of this drama.)

01:09.160 --> 01:10.160
Was he talking about this?

01:11.630 --> 01:12.660
So, that...

01:13.800 --> 01:14.870
was true?

01:16.469 --> 01:17.670
Hey!

01:24.539 --> 01:27.580
Don't hurt Yi Chan, you jerks!

01:38.919 --> 01:40.619
("Two Cops," Seoul Cinema)

01:55.910 --> 01:58.209
Guys, let's get out of here before the cops barge in.

01:59.039 --> 02:00.910
Are you all right? Can you walk?

02:02.780 --> 02:04.979
Hey, hurry up and get on my back.

02:07.619 --> 02:08.619
Don't worry.

02:09.190 --> 02:10.619
I lied about the cops being outside.

02:10.720 --> 02:12.559
Hey, can you handle the consequences?

02:12.959 --> 02:15.030
Once Do Jin finds out that you lied, you're dead meat.

02:15.190 --> 02:17.089
If that happens, I should really call the police.

02:17.929 --> 02:19.530
My uncle is a police chief.

02:19.729 --> 02:20.729
Hey, buddy.

02:21.000 --> 02:22.529
Then you should've called it in...

02:22.530 --> 02:25.000
- way before this happened...
- Shouldn't you clean up the mess?

02:25.239 --> 02:27.340
The security guard will patrol the entire school in the morning.

02:29.669 --> 02:30.909
(Baekwang High School)

02:30.910 --> 02:32.579
(Baekwang High School)

02:40.579 --> 02:41.720
(Security Office)

02:44.389 --> 02:45.419
Oh, no.

02:48.060 --> 02:49.930
(Baekwang High School's Sparkling Festival)

03:02.910 --> 03:04.380
Can you try to hurry?

03:04.609 --> 03:05.710
He'll start patrolling soon.

03:25.030 --> 03:26.030
Hello.

03:26.130 --> 03:27.769
I'm a freshman on the festival preparation committee.

03:28.370 --> 03:29.370
Oh, right.

03:30.329 --> 03:32.239
You were fast asleep earlier.

03:36.009 --> 03:37.009
(Baekwang High School's 25th Anniversary, Sparkling Festival)

03:37.010 --> 03:38.840
Here, hold my arm. I got you.

03:40.109 --> 03:41.150
Gosh, you're heavy.

03:41.479 --> 03:43.609
Are you all right? Don't you feel dizzy?

03:44.250 --> 03:46.078
Let's all go home and get some sleep.

03:46.079 --> 03:47.379
See you guys back at school at noon.

03:47.380 --> 03:50.090
Hey. Are you saying we should go home now, looking like this?

03:50.350 --> 03:52.789
Hey, what a way to worry our parents.

03:55.590 --> 03:56.660
That's true.

03:57.389 --> 03:58.430
The Jindo Dog Gang?

03:59.829 --> 04:00.859
Yes.

04:01.400 --> 04:03.798
So you guys extorted money from other kids, engaged in fistfights,

04:03.799 --> 04:06.139
broke into empty cars together back in middle school.

04:06.539 --> 04:10.009
But you quit all that once you started the band.

04:10.269 --> 04:12.238
And he thinks he went to juvie...

04:12.239 --> 04:13.910
because you reported him to the police?

04:14.079 --> 04:15.109
Correct.

04:15.710 --> 04:17.479
But you never reported him to the police?

04:17.780 --> 04:20.318
That's right. But Do Jin probably knows too.

04:20.319 --> 04:21.749
That I wasn't the one who called it in.

04:21.750 --> 04:23.750
Then why haven't you cleared up the misunderstanding?

04:25.120 --> 04:27.690
He needs someone to take his anger out on. That's why.

04:29.130 --> 04:31.329
To him, I'm a traitor anyway.

04:31.330 --> 04:33.359
Not breaking into empty cars with him doesn't make you a traitor.

04:34.030 --> 04:37.168
Shoot. What if he shows up at our performance and causes a scene?

04:37.169 --> 04:38.239
Don't worry.

04:38.539 --> 04:40.900
He may be reckless, but he's not stupid.

04:41.239 --> 04:43.710
He absolutely can't cause trouble while he's still on probation.

04:43.840 --> 04:45.039
He, of all people, knows that.

04:45.379 --> 04:46.609
You won't go back...

04:47.640 --> 04:49.249
- to your old ways, right?
- What?

04:52.320 --> 04:53.350
No.

04:53.619 --> 04:56.748
You don't have a Jindo dog tattoo, do you?

04:56.749 --> 04:58.618
- No.
- Are you sure?

04:58.619 --> 05:00.590
Hey! I really don't have such a tattoo.

05:00.859 --> 05:02.660
Why don't you search my body if you don't believe me?

05:04.530 --> 05:06.660
What? What is this now?

05:11.799 --> 05:13.939
- Hey!
- Come here!

05:16.470 --> 05:18.038
- Looking nice.
- What do you think?

05:18.039 --> 05:19.909
- Doesn't it look nice?
- Yes.

05:19.910 --> 05:20.979
- Let me see.
- Here.

05:22.609 --> 05:24.850
- Just press it once.
- Oh, this is cool.

05:47.239 --> 05:49.470
- Am I really your dad?
- What?

05:50.410 --> 05:53.510
You said I was your dad, and you were my son.

05:55.609 --> 05:57.349
You said you knew my future...

05:57.350 --> 05:59.580
and that you found out how to change my life.

06:00.080 --> 06:01.489
That's why you wanted to cancel the rehearsal.

06:03.489 --> 06:04.489
How did you know?

06:05.390 --> 06:07.220
How did you show up, knowing I'd get hurt?

06:10.559 --> 06:11.600
The truth is...

06:12.530 --> 06:15.400
My father doesn't like that I'm in a band.

06:18.900 --> 06:20.700
So I ran away from home in the heat of the moment.

06:21.669 --> 06:22.710
But the thing is,

06:23.340 --> 06:26.210
he found out the date of our rehearsal.

06:27.739 --> 06:29.979
If I get caught, he'll send me to a school abroad.

06:31.580 --> 06:33.918
So I had no choice but to lie to you.

06:33.919 --> 06:35.619
I'm sorry.

06:36.450 --> 06:37.989
- Are you telling me the truth?
- Yes, it's true.

06:38.320 --> 06:39.720
- For real?
- Yes, for real.

06:41.429 --> 06:44.999
I knew it. Gosh, you almost had me fooled.

06:45.629 --> 06:46.759
My gosh.

06:46.760 --> 06:48.499
I can't believe I almost fell for such a lie.

06:50.629 --> 06:52.639
Hold on. You're so dead.

06:52.640 --> 06:55.410
How dare you rope Se Gyeong into something like that?

06:55.510 --> 06:56.569
You promised me...

06:56.570 --> 06:58.509
you wouldn't see her until the day of the festival!

06:58.510 --> 06:59.939
Hey! You little...

07:02.679 --> 07:03.808
What?

07:03.809 --> 07:06.049
Hey, the movie is about to start. Where are you going?

07:06.549 --> 07:07.780
Hey, Eun Gyeol!

07:11.760 --> 07:13.960
Hey! Where are you going, naked?

07:30.140 --> 07:32.978
Se Gyeong! I know you're inside.

07:32.979 --> 07:34.910
Come out for a moment. I need to talk to you!

07:35.410 --> 07:38.279
Se Gyeong! One moment would do.

07:38.280 --> 07:40.549
- Choi Se Gyeong!
- Be quiet, or I'll call the police!

07:49.760 --> 07:50.829
I'm sorry.

07:50.830 --> 07:52.228
(Woori Mart)

07:52.229 --> 07:53.760
I wronged you, big time.

07:54.400 --> 07:57.199
The truth is, there's something I can't tell you...

07:57.200 --> 08:00.499
No, I'll tell you. I'm just going to tell you everything.

08:00.970 --> 08:03.510
To tell you the truth, I was worried Yi Chan would get into an accident.

08:03.770 --> 08:04.879
So I... No.

08:05.879 --> 08:07.308
I scrambled to get the rehearsal cancelled,

08:07.309 --> 08:08.780
but they got together again to rehearse.

08:09.679 --> 08:10.679
I mean...

08:16.919 --> 08:17.989
Anyway, I'm sorry.

08:19.059 --> 08:20.488
Go ahead and beat me up if you want to.

08:20.489 --> 08:22.288
Cuss me out all you want.

08:22.289 --> 08:24.160
I don't care what you do if it can make you feel better.

08:24.859 --> 08:26.729
Just don't avoid me, please.

08:27.260 --> 08:28.900
Give me a chance to apologize to you in person...

08:33.700 --> 08:36.169
(Who is the bandsman Mom loved?)

08:39.539 --> 08:41.080
There's something you don't know.

08:41.710 --> 08:43.479
There's nothing I hate more...

08:45.450 --> 08:46.920
than being abandoned.

08:57.960 --> 09:00.560
I was so preoccupied with Dad's accident...

09:01.670 --> 09:03.529
that I let my other missions slip my mind.

09:07.769 --> 09:09.869
I must make Mom smile...

09:10.470 --> 09:12.440
and make sure Mom and Dad can end up together.

09:13.479 --> 09:16.810
And to do that, I must make sure Se Gyeong stays away from Dad.

09:17.680 --> 09:20.080
- And...
- Talk about a cat thief.

09:23.590 --> 09:25.960
I thought I'd successfully kicked you out. Was I wrong?

09:26.220 --> 09:28.460
I must free Mom from that witch too.

09:28.859 --> 09:30.389
Since you're here anyway, empty the guest room.

09:30.830 --> 09:32.399
Get your things and leave.

09:35.769 --> 09:37.369
I never said I'd move out.

09:43.139 --> 09:45.739
You didn't go to school and didn't come home without a word.

09:46.379 --> 09:47.908
Do I need another reason to kick you out?

09:47.909 --> 09:50.979
I faxed the details to Chairman Yoon and got his permission in advance.

09:52.550 --> 09:53.820
I told you.

09:54.519 --> 09:56.350
Chairman Yoon is my employer.

09:56.989 --> 09:58.019
Move out.

09:58.460 --> 10:00.459
Leave quietly while I'm still treating you like a human being.

10:00.460 --> 10:02.529
I told you that Chung Ah was the only person in this household...

10:03.759 --> 10:04.929
that I cared about.

10:04.930 --> 10:06.358
Shall I get you dragged out?

10:06.359 --> 10:08.470
Who are you to tell him to move out?

10:13.139 --> 10:14.300
Welcome home, Mr. Chairman.

10:14.700 --> 10:16.840
Did you have a good business trip?

10:18.040 --> 10:19.738
You should wait in the study.

10:19.739 --> 10:21.210
I'd like to talk to you in private.

10:21.509 --> 10:22.550
Yes, sir.

10:26.749 --> 10:27.879
Since when...

10:28.090 --> 10:30.450
did you start acting like you were the one calling the shots?

10:30.989 --> 10:33.290
- Mr. Chairman.
- Who gave you such authority?

10:35.960 --> 10:37.759
I'm sure you've already looked into it,

10:38.029 --> 10:40.300
but he's a nobody from goodness knows where.

10:40.560 --> 10:42.069
Because he thinks you've got his back,

10:42.070 --> 10:44.330
he's being incredibly arrogant.

10:45.170 --> 10:48.710
More importantly, your two grown daughters live here too.

10:49.210 --> 10:51.878
You're always very cautious when it comes to hiring new people.

10:51.879 --> 10:53.079
I can't believe you hired that boy.

10:53.080 --> 10:55.049
I clearly told you not to try to change my mind...

10:55.050 --> 10:56.778
about him staying with us.

10:56.779 --> 10:58.779
- Mr. Chairman.
- End of discussion!

11:02.050 --> 11:03.090
Mr. Chairman.

11:08.019 --> 11:09.060
They say...

11:10.060 --> 11:14.159
blood is thicker than water. I hope that's not why you're fond of him.

11:19.639 --> 11:21.570
With that remark,

11:22.570 --> 11:25.009
you flat out insulted Ju Yeop and Sang A...

11:25.440 --> 11:27.340
while making me look like a despicable scumbag.

11:28.710 --> 11:29.710
Are you satisfied?

11:37.519 --> 11:40.290
- Pardon me?
- I'm terminating our agreement.

11:40.590 --> 11:44.430
But there are still five days left in the agreement.

11:44.960 --> 11:47.999
It's too slow. When investing, timing is everything.

11:50.930 --> 11:52.999
Sir, you probably don't know this,

11:53.170 --> 11:55.639
but Chung Ah has changed a lot.

11:56.009 --> 11:57.339
Her sign language has improved a lot,

11:57.340 --> 11:58.709
and she has many friends now.

11:58.710 --> 12:00.238
She has learned to open up to others,

12:00.239 --> 12:01.379
and most importantly,

12:02.479 --> 12:03.779
she smiles often now.

12:03.979 --> 12:06.279
I suppose you've forgotten the terms of our agreement.

12:06.479 --> 12:09.388
You promised to show me her smile.

12:09.389 --> 12:12.289
You're away so often because of your work trips.

12:12.290 --> 12:14.960
Shall I forget about the company and stay home every day, then?

12:17.330 --> 12:18.930
In any case, this is not fair.

12:19.200 --> 12:20.398
The head of a conglomerate...

12:20.399 --> 12:22.028
wrongfully dismissing a young employee like this...

12:22.029 --> 12:23.998
So I'd like to extend it by one month.

12:23.999 --> 12:25.670
Then I'll have to report you to the Labour Board...

12:26.440 --> 12:29.039
Pardon me? You'd like to extend it?

12:29.040 --> 12:31.840
We'll cancel the original agreement and extend it by one month.

12:32.040 --> 12:35.550
However, I'll be tweaking the terms and conditions.

12:35.850 --> 12:36.879
The terms and conditions?

12:37.810 --> 12:38.879
How?

12:40.080 --> 12:41.690
She has to smile at me.

12:43.190 --> 12:44.220
Who?

12:45.359 --> 12:46.420
Chung Ah?

12:46.759 --> 12:48.460
Why? You don't think you can do it?

12:53.029 --> 12:54.060
I'll try.

12:54.970 --> 12:56.670
All right, that's it. You can go.

13:02.570 --> 13:04.439
- Sir.
- I won't help you.

13:04.440 --> 13:05.639
Figure things out on your own.

13:05.909 --> 13:07.540
I really want you to see it.

13:08.580 --> 13:09.649
See what?

13:09.779 --> 13:11.109
Chung Ah's smile.

13:13.119 --> 13:14.519
She has such a pretty smile.

13:36.570 --> 13:39.609
Which one did I like more before I left to go study abroad?

13:39.840 --> 13:40.879
Ha Eun Gyeol.

13:41.909 --> 13:44.080
I have no doubt that Eun Gyeol is the one she likes.

13:46.720 --> 13:47.979
(Ha Eun Gyeol)

13:49.249 --> 13:50.290
Ha Eun Gyeol.

13:51.149 --> 13:52.559
I'm certain...

13:52.560 --> 13:55.129
that Se Gyeong will choose Eun Gyeol today, not Yi Chan.

14:04.200 --> 14:06.600
You'll come to the festival today, right?

14:07.970 --> 14:09.570
Yes, I'll be there.

14:16.779 --> 14:18.649
I won't let Mom cry, no matter what.

14:19.320 --> 14:20.820
I must do whatever it takes...

14:21.149 --> 14:23.749
to win Se Gyeong's heart before the festival begins.

14:26.690 --> 14:27.690
Se Gyeong!

14:28.629 --> 14:30.330
Are you going to the festival at Baekwang High later today?

14:31.129 --> 14:33.099
Well, I guess you're going.

14:33.100 --> 14:36.128
What? Why would I go there?

14:36.129 --> 14:37.499
Clearly, you're going.

14:37.830 --> 14:39.969
Well, if you say you're going,

14:39.970 --> 14:43.069
I should probably go with you.

14:43.070 --> 14:45.440
I mean, I can't let you walk into the wolves' den all by yourself.

14:45.580 --> 14:48.079
You don't really look like you care whether or not I'll be there.

14:48.080 --> 14:50.080
What do you mean? What do I look like, then?

14:51.680 --> 14:53.249
You look like an outcast trying so hard...

14:54.580 --> 14:55.649
to fit in.

14:57.090 --> 14:59.090
What does that mean? Is that supposed to be a compliment?

14:59.920 --> 15:02.229
What does it mean? Se Gyeong.

15:02.960 --> 15:05.729
Se Gyeong. Answer me, will you?

15:13.670 --> 15:14.940
Se Gyeong, can we talk?

15:16.009 --> 15:17.869
Hi, good morning.

15:20.580 --> 15:22.779
What was that? Did she use sign language just now?

15:23.249 --> 15:25.920
Is she out of her mind? What if people think she's deaf?

15:28.489 --> 15:29.749
Sorry. Get going.

15:32.119 --> 15:33.920
Something's going on between those two, right?

15:34.290 --> 15:35.359
You must know something.

15:36.259 --> 15:38.999
Those little... Hey!

15:39.700 --> 15:42.600
Se Gyeong, let's talk.

15:44.869 --> 15:45.970
I'll tell you everything.

15:48.239 --> 15:50.639
I said I'd tell you my secret when the time was right.

15:51.909 --> 15:52.979
I'll tell you all about it now.

15:56.310 --> 15:58.050
I don't know if you'll believe me,

15:59.249 --> 16:01.749
- but I'm actually...
- My parents got a divorce.

16:02.119 --> 16:03.189
What?

16:03.190 --> 16:05.720
And they fought over me for a whole year.

16:06.920 --> 16:08.389
I thought they loved me,

16:09.060 --> 16:10.129
but I was wrong.

16:10.629 --> 16:12.330
They both had their own goals and agendas.

16:13.159 --> 16:15.829
My dad didn't want to look like a bad person who abandoned his child,

16:15.830 --> 16:18.840
and my mom needed a fancy accessory that could make her life shine.

16:19.470 --> 16:20.639
I'm done being the girl...

16:20.899 --> 16:24.310
who is only loved when she is needed or useful.

16:24.739 --> 16:27.840
I don't want to be anyone's trophy, war booty, or accessory.

16:28.279 --> 16:29.310
That's not what I'm doing.

16:29.710 --> 16:31.310
- I'm...
- This is like a hunting game.

16:32.249 --> 16:33.278
What?

16:33.279 --> 16:35.489
All men like to trophy-hunt.

16:36.889 --> 16:38.050
Don't say you're different.

16:39.090 --> 16:40.159
You're not any different.

16:40.720 --> 16:42.059
You'd stuff the animals you caught,

16:42.060 --> 16:44.089
hang them on your wall, and boast about how you hunted them.

16:44.090 --> 16:45.299
When you get tired of it, you won't care...

16:45.300 --> 16:46.499
whether they collect dust or disappear.

16:46.659 --> 16:47.830
You'll just neglect them.

16:48.600 --> 16:50.930
- Se Gyeong.
- Give up already.

16:51.470 --> 16:53.269
I will not let you catch me.

16:53.470 --> 16:56.009
I do not want to get stuffed and hung on someone's wall.

16:59.479 --> 17:00.540
So?

17:02.080 --> 17:03.409
Will you choose Yi Chan?

17:04.180 --> 17:05.450
Why do you care?

17:10.420 --> 17:11.790
Then don't come to the festival.

17:15.359 --> 17:17.029
If you're coming, you have to choose me.

17:18.060 --> 17:19.060
Get lost.

17:19.500 --> 17:21.159
Don't you dare tell me what to do.

17:36.580 --> 17:37.649
Hey.

17:38.850 --> 17:40.149
Were you waiting for me?

17:40.520 --> 17:42.290
Why? Do you need to talk to me about something?

17:44.419 --> 17:45.419
You know, today...

17:46.090 --> 17:47.959
You'll choose Eun Gyeol, right?

17:49.560 --> 17:52.730
No, bet your money on Yi Chan.

17:53.459 --> 17:55.600
It's just between you and me.

18:01.139 --> 18:03.209
From now on, I'm only going to focus on my mission.

18:04.439 --> 18:05.480
I'll only think about the mission.

18:11.179 --> 18:13.878
- Watermelons are here!
- Watermelons!

18:13.879 --> 18:17.618
- Sweet, fresh watermelons!
- Watermelons!

18:17.619 --> 18:19.918
- Watermelons that can sing well...
- We can sing well!

18:19.919 --> 18:21.958
- and play great music!
- We can play music!

18:21.959 --> 18:23.928
Delicious watermelons are here!

18:23.929 --> 18:25.398
- We're here!
- We're here!

18:25.399 --> 18:27.999
This evening at 5pm.

18:28.000 --> 18:29.128
What time?

18:29.129 --> 18:30.428
- At 5pm!
- At 5pm!

18:30.429 --> 18:31.799
One more time. What time?

18:31.800 --> 18:33.138
- At 5pm!
- At 5pm!

18:33.139 --> 18:34.898
All right. Where?

18:34.899 --> 18:36.769
- The gymnasium!
- The gymnasium!

18:36.770 --> 18:39.280
Come and watch us perform at the festival.

18:39.580 --> 18:41.280
All right, We are...

18:42.449 --> 18:44.178
Come and watch us perform!

18:44.179 --> 18:45.819
Who are we?

18:45.820 --> 18:47.850
- Watermelon Sugar!
- Watermelon Sugar!

18:47.949 --> 18:50.089
- Viva!
- La Vida!

18:50.090 --> 18:52.389
- Watermelon!
- Sugar!

18:52.619 --> 18:53.958
We are...

18:53.959 --> 18:55.628
- Superstar Watermelon...
- Superstar Watermelon...

18:55.629 --> 18:58.060
- Sugar!
- Sugar!

19:00.199 --> 19:02.270
- Yes! Hello!
- Hi!

19:02.399 --> 19:03.669
Yes, you should all come!

19:03.770 --> 19:05.699
Everyone, come and watch us perform.

19:09.270 --> 19:11.069
- Can I get one too?
- Here.

19:11.070 --> 19:12.878
- So who's coming?
- Me!

19:12.879 --> 19:15.448
Wait, hold on. Excuse me.

19:15.449 --> 19:17.009
- Here you go.
- I want one too.

19:17.010 --> 19:19.649
(Baekwang High School's 25th Anniversary, Sparkling Festival)

19:22.889 --> 19:24.090
Surprise.

19:25.859 --> 19:27.189
You came really early.

19:28.859 --> 19:32.030
Shall I give you a tour of my school?

19:37.570 --> 19:39.070
I have to go back to school.

19:39.399 --> 19:41.369
They suddenly decided to hold a supplementary class.

19:42.969 --> 19:44.810
"School?" "Class?"

19:46.109 --> 19:48.379
Oh, I see. You have to go back to school?

19:50.580 --> 19:53.679
What? Then...

19:54.619 --> 19:57.889
Why did you come here so early?

20:10.230 --> 20:11.230
My gosh.

20:17.040 --> 20:18.240
Gosh, this is so cool!

20:19.980 --> 20:21.080
Is this for me?

20:24.449 --> 20:25.479
It's my gift to you.

20:25.480 --> 20:27.850
"Gift?" That's what it means, right?

20:29.219 --> 20:32.159
Did you make these for me?

20:34.020 --> 20:36.429
Thank you. Seriously, thanks a lot.

20:37.590 --> 20:39.199
I'll definitely use this when I perform later.

20:39.560 --> 20:40.600
Like this.

20:42.570 --> 20:45.000
Oh, right. You'll come and see us perform later, right?

20:47.040 --> 20:49.869
You'll come to my performance, right?

20:51.240 --> 20:53.879
No, I won't be there.

20:58.050 --> 20:59.320
You have to come.

20:59.820 --> 21:03.090
Come and clap along like this... No.

21:04.389 --> 21:05.490
Do this.

21:08.119 --> 21:09.159
No.

21:09.929 --> 21:13.800
Today, I can't twinkle like you.

21:16.800 --> 21:17.800
See you later.

21:27.840 --> 21:29.679
It was great knowing you, Yi Chan.

21:30.709 --> 21:32.149
Good luck with your performance.

21:33.250 --> 21:34.280
And...

21:51.270 --> 21:53.600
I hope you win.

22:06.850 --> 22:08.448
(Buy Watermelon Sugar souvenirs.)

22:08.449 --> 22:10.689
(Selling souvenirs chosen by Choi Se Gyeong)

22:14.020 --> 22:16.489
Hey, I told you to put Eun Gyeol's photo at the front.

22:16.490 --> 22:17.729
Do you not know how to sell things?

22:17.730 --> 22:19.260
It's like a bait item, you dummy.

22:19.500 --> 22:21.799
- To make girls open their wallets.
- Hello.

22:21.800 --> 22:23.569
He's like the epitome of freshness.

22:23.570 --> 22:24.698
Whatever. Put these away.

22:24.699 --> 22:26.399
I'll donate these to the spirit photography club.

22:27.270 --> 22:28.500
- Hey, you're here.
- Yes.

22:28.600 --> 22:30.510
Sorry. Cleaning took longer than I thought.

22:30.709 --> 22:31.740
Where's Yi Chan?

22:31.939 --> 22:33.679
Gosh, I'm so popular.

22:34.280 --> 22:35.908
Everyone's looking for me, wherever I go.

22:35.909 --> 22:38.549
Hey, we're so busy. Where have you been?

22:38.550 --> 22:40.418
I had to stop by the woodworking room to make something.

22:40.419 --> 22:42.820
- What did you make?
- Try and find it.

22:43.350 --> 22:44.850
Gosh, this is so cool. Where did you get this?

22:44.949 --> 22:46.619
Hey, I don't know.

22:46.719 --> 22:48.189
Chung Ah gave it to me and left.

22:48.359 --> 22:50.729
Mom... I mean, Chung Ah was here?

22:50.730 --> 22:53.858
Yes. She's very professional.

22:53.859 --> 22:55.869
See? She takes such good care of the frontman.

22:56.129 --> 22:58.939
What should I do? I haven't even reconciled with Se Gyeong yet.

22:59.000 --> 23:00.938
Why didn't you bring her here? Why are you here alone?

23:00.939 --> 23:03.168
She had to go back to her class. She'll come back after her class.

23:03.169 --> 23:04.209
She's got a class?

23:04.869 --> 23:06.579
Oh, no. The rumour was true.

23:06.580 --> 23:08.439
Rumour? What rumour?

23:08.810 --> 23:10.509
Seowon Arts High is notorious for doing this.

23:10.510 --> 23:11.708
They suddenly hold supplementary classes...

23:11.709 --> 23:13.350
whenever there's a school festival in the area.

23:13.419 --> 23:15.320
- Why?
- What do you think?

23:15.520 --> 23:17.519
Getting excited about festivals could negatively impact...

23:17.520 --> 23:18.819
their students' grades,

23:18.820 --> 23:20.820
and they don't want their students to date and cause trouble.

23:21.020 --> 23:23.429
What? Does that mean Se Gyeong might not make it?

23:24.290 --> 23:27.459
Hey, a model student like Se Gyeong won't skip her supplementary class.

23:27.699 --> 23:28.730
You idiot.

23:31.770 --> 23:32.868
No wonder...

23:32.869 --> 23:35.139
I didn't really see anyone wearing Seowon Arts High's uniform.

23:37.270 --> 23:39.810
We're doomed. We failed.

23:40.080 --> 23:42.279
Gosh, what should we do?

23:42.280 --> 23:45.209
We need to sell everything here to cover our costs.

23:45.510 --> 23:46.849
It's okay, guys.

23:46.850 --> 23:48.619
As our frontman said,

23:48.780 --> 23:50.948
"If you push the wall, it becomes a bridge. If you fall..."

23:50.949 --> 23:52.218
Oh, Choi Se Gyeong is here!

23:52.219 --> 23:54.259
- What? Choi Se Gyeong?
- What?

23:54.260 --> 23:56.628
- My gosh!
- Se Gyeong!

23:56.629 --> 23:57.830
- Come on, quick!
- Se Gyeong!

23:59.929 --> 24:01.029
- Oh, my.
- There she is.

24:01.030 --> 24:03.000
- Hey, that's Choi Se Gyeong.
- She's really pretty.

24:03.500 --> 24:04.929
- My gosh.
- She's so pretty.

24:06.199 --> 24:07.369
Where you fall...

24:08.240 --> 24:11.310
You will find a hidden treasure!

24:21.020 --> 24:22.749
Se Gyeong, you came.

24:22.750 --> 24:24.689
Of course, I promised you that I would.

24:24.820 --> 24:26.889
- My gosh.
- Oh, my.

24:26.990 --> 24:28.418
Se Gyeong, can we talk?

24:28.419 --> 24:30.929
Just so you know, this has nothing to do with the bet.

24:30.990 --> 24:33.330
You'd better do a good job with your performance today.

24:36.230 --> 24:38.770
Of course. You know who the performance is for.

24:40.240 --> 24:41.438
- Hey.
- Oh, right.

24:41.439 --> 24:44.468
We still have plenty of time. Shall I give you a tour of the school?

24:44.469 --> 24:46.439
- Sure!
- Or do you want to see our booth?

24:46.540 --> 24:48.638
Well, give me a tour of your school first...

24:48.639 --> 24:49.948
I'll give you a tour. Spare me a moment...

24:49.949 --> 24:52.378
Actually, I want to check out your booth first.

24:52.379 --> 24:53.579
Let's go. Where is it, Ma Joo?

24:53.580 --> 24:54.820
Follow me!

24:55.020 --> 24:56.020
Let's go!

24:57.820 --> 24:59.689
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

24:59.859 --> 25:01.218
This is it here.

25:01.219 --> 25:02.989
This is your booth. It looks nice.

25:02.990 --> 25:04.189
You guys did a good job.

25:05.290 --> 25:06.299
Look, Se Gyeong.

25:06.300 --> 25:08.559
I displayed the photos you took.

25:08.560 --> 25:10.969
I see. But you guys haven't sold a single one.

25:11.570 --> 25:12.668
Shall I be your first customer?

25:12.669 --> 25:14.000
- Really?
- Yes.

25:14.939 --> 25:16.010
Hold on.

25:16.139 --> 25:18.868
Let's see. First, I want Ma Joo's photo.

25:18.869 --> 25:19.879
Yes!

25:20.139 --> 25:21.379
Next, Se Bum.

25:21.939 --> 25:23.209
Hyun Yul.

25:23.510 --> 25:24.979
(Lee Si Guk)

25:24.980 --> 25:26.019
Si Guk.

25:26.020 --> 25:27.049
(Ha Yi Chan)

25:27.050 --> 25:29.388
And my cute Yi Chan.

25:29.389 --> 25:30.819
(Ha Eun Gyeol)

25:30.820 --> 25:33.218
All right, that would do. Can I get the T-shirt too?

25:33.219 --> 25:34.419
You want the T-shirt? Okay.

25:34.490 --> 25:36.888
Here it is.

25:36.889 --> 25:37.889
Here.

25:38.859 --> 25:40.559
- It'll look good on me, right?
- Of course!

25:40.560 --> 25:43.129
That's a given. Why bother asking?

25:45.669 --> 25:48.439
- Oh, my.
- Applause!

25:49.669 --> 25:50.839
I want one too!

25:50.840 --> 25:52.378
Okay, what size?

25:52.379 --> 25:53.779
- Okay.
- I need one too!

25:53.780 --> 25:56.350
Yes!

25:57.949 --> 25:59.148
Se Gyeong!

25:59.149 --> 26:01.319
- Hi.
- Hi. You know...

26:01.320 --> 26:04.089
Can you please come and play the game my club organized?

26:04.090 --> 26:06.519
It's the most famous game at the festival. Let's play...

26:06.520 --> 26:07.789
- No.
- Why not?

26:07.790 --> 26:09.458
She's a cellist. What if she hurts her hand?

26:09.459 --> 26:11.959
No, Yi Chan. It sounds fun. Let's play it together.

26:12.330 --> 26:13.429
- Shall we?
- Yes.

26:13.530 --> 26:15.299
Guys, we should all do it together. What do you say?

26:15.300 --> 26:16.368
- Shall we?
- Sure.

26:16.369 --> 26:17.529
Wait, hold on.

26:17.530 --> 26:19.800
One person should stay and man the booth. Who will stay?

26:31.580 --> 26:35.550
- Choi Se Gyeong!
- Choi Se Gyeong!

26:37.790 --> 26:38.850
Eun Gyeol.

26:39.659 --> 26:40.790
How's it going here?

26:40.990 --> 26:42.219
Where's everyone else?

26:42.490 --> 26:43.490
What?

26:44.429 --> 26:45.730
Watch the booth for me.

26:46.500 --> 26:47.600
What? Where are you going?

26:48.699 --> 26:51.829
All eyes are on us now! This is the match of the century.

26:51.830 --> 26:53.368
It's happening right now, today!

26:53.369 --> 26:55.069
Sworn enemies met on a single-log bridge.

26:55.070 --> 26:57.708
Round Four! Hold in your burps after downing the soda!

26:57.709 --> 27:00.310
Applause, everyone!

27:03.080 --> 27:05.178
You get one minute.

27:05.179 --> 27:06.179
Are you ready?

27:06.879 --> 27:08.480
Are you ready? Stand by.

27:09.419 --> 27:10.449
Start!

27:29.770 --> 27:32.539
- Choi Se Gyeong!
- Choi Se Gyeong!

27:32.540 --> 27:35.239
- Choi Se Gyeong!
- Seven, six,

27:35.240 --> 27:38.049
- Choi Se Gyeong!
- five, four, three, two,

27:38.050 --> 27:39.750
- Choi Se Gyeong!
- one. You team lost!

27:44.619 --> 27:48.618
- Choi Se Gyeong!
- Choi Se Gyeong!

27:48.619 --> 27:50.229
Round Five!

27:50.230 --> 27:54.229
Who can make the biggest bubble?

27:54.230 --> 27:56.529
All right. Get ready and start!

27:56.530 --> 27:58.469
Go!

28:00.669 --> 28:02.169
- Nice, that's it.
- Keep going.

28:02.909 --> 28:05.469
- Oh, my!
- My gosh!

28:31.669 --> 28:33.299
Quiet down!

28:33.300 --> 28:34.569
(Baekwang High School's Sparkling Festival)

28:34.570 --> 28:35.639
Quiet down, please.

28:40.639 --> 28:42.080
No chitchat.

28:42.550 --> 28:44.209
- Be quiet.
- Sorry.

28:44.379 --> 28:45.480
Wait in an orderly fashion.

28:47.619 --> 28:49.079
Stay seated.

28:49.080 --> 28:50.290
Se Gyeong.

28:51.250 --> 28:53.719
I said we should go together, but you left without me.

28:53.990 --> 28:55.559
Will you keep hurting my feelings like this?

28:55.560 --> 28:56.829
You're the chairwoman's daughter.

28:56.830 --> 28:58.589
Was I supposed to lure you into skipping the class with me?

28:58.590 --> 28:59.929
That's exactly my point.

29:00.399 --> 29:02.529
I skipped the supplementary class and came here because of you,

29:02.530 --> 29:03.929
but you aren't even happy to see me.

29:04.429 --> 29:07.469
I asked you about my style earlier, but you ignored me.

29:08.939 --> 29:10.369
You're stylish, so you don't care how I look?

29:10.740 --> 29:12.270
I thought we were closer than this!

29:15.780 --> 29:17.080
That headband doesn't suit you.

29:18.149 --> 29:20.779
- What?
- I think you're Cool Summer.

29:20.780 --> 29:23.189
Such vivid colours are the worst for those with Cool Summer tones.

29:23.350 --> 29:25.789
You should go for muted tones or mauve.

29:25.790 --> 29:27.990
"Cool Summer?"

29:28.359 --> 29:30.929
"Vivi..." What?

29:31.159 --> 29:32.260
Hey.

29:32.389 --> 29:35.199
Let's keep our mouths shut and get ready to enjoy the performance.

29:36.800 --> 29:38.499
Hey, it'll be a lame performance anyway.

29:38.500 --> 29:39.799
The band was put together at the last minute.

29:39.800 --> 29:41.600
It'll look like a kids' talent show.

29:43.770 --> 29:45.439
(The début show of Watermelon Sugar)

29:59.490 --> 30:00.719
I can do this. Yes.

30:23.280 --> 30:24.280
Son.

30:27.050 --> 30:28.679
What is it? Are you already nervous?

30:34.260 --> 30:35.320
Yi Chan.

30:35.520 --> 30:37.359
What? Shall I pick up some calming medicine for you?

30:43.669 --> 30:45.399
I won't go easy on you today.

30:47.469 --> 30:48.570
You think you're the only one?

30:50.869 --> 30:51.909
Hey, I have one too.

30:52.740 --> 30:54.409
Stop acting cool.

30:55.980 --> 30:58.209
They'll call a standby in three minutes. Are you guys ready?

30:58.310 --> 31:00.350
Of course. Come on, brothers.

31:04.050 --> 31:06.659
- You can do a good job, right?
- Yes. I always do a good job.

31:07.189 --> 31:08.189
You too?

31:08.459 --> 31:10.159
With each mistake you make, you'll get three teeth knocked out.

31:10.359 --> 31:12.260
Then you'll get dentures soon, Yi Chan.

31:14.159 --> 31:15.230
All right.

31:15.959 --> 31:17.329
Who are we?

31:17.330 --> 31:19.199
- Watermelon Sugar!
- Watermelon Sugar!

31:20.270 --> 31:21.340
Viva!

31:22.070 --> 31:23.540
- La Vida!
- La Vida!

31:24.270 --> 31:25.409
Watermelon!

31:26.280 --> 31:27.479
- Sugar!
- Sugar!

31:27.480 --> 31:29.810
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

31:32.719 --> 31:36.520
Your face

31:37.490 --> 31:41.020
Your name

31:42.260 --> 31:45.760
Your story

31:47.030 --> 31:51.230
And I'm left with

31:56.770 --> 31:57.810
Drums!

32:01.209 --> 32:02.209
Bass!

32:05.810 --> 32:06.850
Guitar!

32:10.649 --> 32:11.689
Piano!

32:15.760 --> 32:19.699
It still wasn't enough

32:20.659 --> 32:24.770
The way you were looking at me

32:25.030 --> 32:29.239
Like the love scattered around the world

32:29.240 --> 32:32.469
Everything was uncertain back then

32:34.209 --> 32:38.350
As time goes by

32:39.080 --> 32:43.250
We're bound to forget things

32:43.490 --> 32:47.789
But it is now that I am leaving

32:47.790 --> 32:50.830
Your shadows behind

32:52.929 --> 32:58.229
I never told you that I loved you

32:58.230 --> 33:02.168
Although I regret it now

33:02.169 --> 33:06.178
Your late confession

33:06.179 --> 33:10.709
I'm leaving that confession behind

33:11.949 --> 33:13.919
Everybody, get up!

33:15.820 --> 33:20.358
Your face, your name

33:20.359 --> 33:24.989
Your story and my lovely bygone days

33:24.990 --> 33:29.569
It may seem like this love came true

33:29.570 --> 33:33.969
But I'm left with nothing but a farewell

33:53.219 --> 33:55.188
Amazing! My gosh.

33:55.189 --> 33:56.990
He's so good.

33:57.760 --> 33:59.260
Hold on. Ha Eun Gyeol, that guy...

34:00.030 --> 34:01.059
Wasn't it him?

34:01.060 --> 34:03.000
The one who had a jam session with Ji Hwan's band.

34:03.830 --> 34:06.030
Who did what?

34:06.199 --> 34:07.899
Those two.

34:08.270 --> 34:09.609
With Ji Hwan's band.

34:10.070 --> 34:11.070
Dad...

34:11.770 --> 34:14.879
No, I mean... Ji Hwan is in a band?

34:15.179 --> 34:16.179
Hey, what's with you?

34:16.180 --> 34:19.079
You came with me when I went to Myeongse Outdoor Theatre.

34:19.080 --> 34:21.619
To see Ji Hwan's band perform. Don't you remember?

34:23.219 --> 34:24.819
Yes, it's him.

34:25.190 --> 34:27.060
No wonder I thought he looked so familiar.

34:28.659 --> 34:30.190
Se Gyeong. You knew, didn't you?

34:31.529 --> 34:33.359
Where are you going? Are you going to the restroom?

34:33.360 --> 34:34.900
It's bright outside

34:37.600 --> 34:39.069
Walking briskly

34:40.000 --> 34:42.540
In the morning

34:44.409 --> 34:46.239
Everyone is

34:46.839 --> 34:48.980
Humming together

34:51.949 --> 34:55.678
Waiting for a sunny day

34:55.679 --> 34:59.149
With a heart full of excitement

34:59.150 --> 35:02.689
Crossing paths

35:02.690 --> 35:06.159
Affectionate gazes fill the streets

35:07.259 --> 35:08.259
- Hey!
- Hey!

35:10.830 --> 35:11.830
- Hey!
- Hey!

35:14.940 --> 35:17.110
Did I tell you my first love was in a band?

35:17.869 --> 35:20.580
So the bandsman was Dad?

35:21.679 --> 35:23.409
You see, my first love...

35:26.179 --> 35:28.319
He was cheerful and bright like sunshine.

35:36.219 --> 35:38.060
He seemed indifferent and cold from time to time,

35:38.860 --> 35:40.560
but he was kind.

35:57.279 --> 35:59.480
(You're my music.)

36:05.319 --> 36:07.119
And he only loved me, always.

36:12.489 --> 36:13.699
Look, what a handsome dog.

36:15.000 --> 36:16.029
This won't be spicy, right?

36:16.299 --> 36:17.500
It looks spicy.

36:18.230 --> 36:19.330
I'll try it.

36:20.170 --> 36:21.199
Isn't it spicy?

36:21.600 --> 36:23.738
Oh, that's right. He was very good at eating spicy food.

36:23.739 --> 36:25.310
- It's not spicy at all.
- It's not spicy?

36:25.839 --> 36:26.880
Try it.

36:31.279 --> 36:32.750
I couldn't handle spicy food.

36:34.250 --> 36:35.279
Oh, gosh.

36:38.690 --> 36:40.258
- Oh, my gosh.
- My gosh.

36:40.259 --> 36:42.588
- You're handsome.
- Oh, my gosh.

36:42.589 --> 36:44.488
How can he be so good-looking?

36:44.489 --> 36:47.259
- He's handsome.
- He's handsome.

36:49.159 --> 36:50.199
What?

36:51.369 --> 36:53.499
- My goodness.
- How is he so sweet?

36:53.500 --> 36:55.969
He's so cool.

36:56.069 --> 36:57.509
I didn't know when I was younger.

36:58.440 --> 37:01.509
Because we were like siblings.

37:02.509 --> 37:03.580
But...

37:04.179 --> 37:09.650
You're a beautiful woman

37:10.049 --> 37:14.159
And I'm happy

37:15.989 --> 37:18.360
You're like much-needed rain

37:19.060 --> 37:23.869
You're like much-needed rain to my dry heart

37:25.069 --> 37:29.499
You're like the scent of dawn that is forgotten

37:29.500 --> 37:31.569
I was sure that he was the one...

37:31.869 --> 37:33.139
at the spring festival.

37:34.779 --> 37:38.008
That day, he serenaded me...

37:38.009 --> 37:40.049
at the festival.

37:50.830 --> 37:52.960
He was my dad?

37:55.360 --> 37:58.600
Your first love was my dad when he was younger?

38:04.210 --> 38:05.270
Se Gyeong.

38:09.279 --> 38:10.480
Do you know me?

38:17.319 --> 38:18.489
Do you know me?

38:21.819 --> 38:24.060
I'm sorry. I was mistaken.

38:28.159 --> 38:30.469
It's okay.

38:33.900 --> 38:35.600
That was awesome.

38:38.770 --> 38:39.838
(Baekwang High School's Sparkling Festival)

38:39.839 --> 38:42.778
Are you guys having fun?

38:42.779 --> 38:44.079
- Yes.
- Yes.

38:44.080 --> 38:45.909
I can't hear you.

38:46.279 --> 38:48.880
Say it louder!

38:49.080 --> 38:52.388
Are you guys having fun?

38:52.389 --> 38:54.559
- Yes.
- Yes.

38:54.560 --> 38:55.619
Thank you.

38:57.360 --> 38:59.589
I'm going to dedicate the last song...

39:02.860 --> 39:04.569
to a girl.

39:09.600 --> 39:11.369
I'm going...

39:11.969 --> 39:14.509
to sing this song...

39:15.009 --> 39:18.210
for the girl who made our band possible.

39:20.179 --> 39:23.150
It's "The Magic Castle" by The Classic.

39:24.089 --> 39:25.250
Darn it.

39:29.860 --> 39:31.730
(Baekwang High School's Sparkling Festival)

40:01.060 --> 40:05.589
When I gaze at the setting sun, tinged with red

40:05.989 --> 40:09.230
The sad look on your face comes to my mind

40:09.730 --> 40:13.199
I sink my head, and tears fall down

40:13.400 --> 40:15.939
There's nothing I can say

40:15.940 --> 40:18.869
But the truth is that I love you

40:19.540 --> 40:22.310
You are my world

40:23.080 --> 40:25.908
I'm screaming that to the world

40:25.909 --> 40:29.989
But the setting sun burns silently

40:30.719 --> 40:33.889
(Watermelon Sugar)

40:33.960 --> 40:36.360
- Can I have your autograph?
- Gosh.

40:37.589 --> 40:39.629
- What's your name?
- Hye In.

40:39.630 --> 40:41.059
- Sorry?
- Hye In.

40:41.060 --> 40:42.159
Hye In.

40:45.699 --> 40:46.699
Then...

40:51.239 --> 40:52.940
Where are you going? There's an after-party.

40:53.580 --> 40:56.338
Sign the autograph for me before you go.

40:56.339 --> 40:57.809
Just for me.

40:57.810 --> 40:59.178
- It's my bad.
- No.

40:59.179 --> 41:00.979
- Viva.
- La Vida.

41:00.980 --> 41:03.420
- Watermelon.
- Sugar.

41:05.290 --> 41:07.959
Look. The table looks so beautiful...

41:07.960 --> 41:09.959
when you order the right amount of food for you.

41:09.960 --> 41:12.089
So is there anything else you need?

41:12.929 --> 41:14.299
One more free plate of fried dumplings, please.

41:14.659 --> 41:17.529
I could raise a cow, but I can't raise you.

41:18.270 --> 41:19.940
One more seafood and vegetables with mustard sauce, please.

41:21.139 --> 41:23.368
- Oh, my.
- Oh, my.

41:23.369 --> 41:25.239
I'm going to raise a cow today.

41:25.310 --> 41:27.380
I can tell that you're blessed with luck.

41:27.909 --> 41:29.679
You're definitely going to become rich.

41:30.850 --> 41:32.150
Give us stir-fried seafood and beef too.

41:32.449 --> 41:35.879
- Oh Ma Joo.
- Oh Ma Joo.

41:35.880 --> 41:38.349
Seafood and vegetables with mustard and stir-fried seafood and beef.

41:38.350 --> 41:40.219
- Let's get it started.
- Let's do it.

41:40.819 --> 41:42.790
Can you really eat the noodles right now?

41:45.029 --> 41:48.429
Didn't you think that something was off while performing today?

41:55.170 --> 41:56.539
It's okay.

41:56.540 --> 41:59.369
We lost the bet, but it was a successful performance.

41:59.869 --> 42:02.310
Yes. Se Gyeong is very considerate.

42:02.779 --> 42:04.849
She didn't reject you...

42:04.850 --> 42:06.310
in front of the whole school.

42:06.679 --> 42:08.849
"Reject?" Who?

42:08.850 --> 42:10.019
You.

42:10.020 --> 42:11.619
She didn't reject me.

42:12.190 --> 42:14.318
Kind Se Gyeong finished it with an open ending...

42:14.319 --> 42:15.860
with the wisdom of Solomon.

42:16.790 --> 42:19.759
Because she didn't want to choose one of us and hurt the other.

42:20.560 --> 42:22.400
Because she didn't want us to disband.

42:23.130 --> 42:24.799
That's who she is.

42:25.369 --> 42:28.198
She's righteous and loyal.

42:28.199 --> 42:31.068
I thought it was a cartoon theme song or something.

42:31.069 --> 42:32.139
Are you done now?

42:33.239 --> 42:35.540
Let's slurp the noodles now.

42:35.639 --> 42:36.710
Sounds great.

42:40.350 --> 42:42.380
What do you mean I'm done, you punks?

42:42.619 --> 42:44.449
Chung Ah isn't here.

42:45.049 --> 42:46.859
- Oh, right.
- Chung Ah?

42:46.860 --> 42:48.119
"Oh, right?"

42:48.960 --> 42:50.060
Gosh.

42:50.759 --> 42:52.730
These disloyal punks.

42:53.060 --> 42:55.428
You just want to eat even when your colleague...

42:55.429 --> 42:57.869
who has always been with us isn't here.

42:59.369 --> 43:01.199
You're no better than animals.

43:11.350 --> 43:12.750
Can we meet for a moment?

43:12.980 --> 43:14.819
You decide the time and the location.

43:15.580 --> 43:16.750
Why are you not answering?

43:17.889 --> 43:19.350
Are you not home yet?

43:20.690 --> 43:22.119
Is the fax broken?

43:23.119 --> 43:24.259
(Are you unwell?)

43:26.489 --> 43:27.699
Are you unwell?

43:29.429 --> 43:30.969
Did something happen?

43:32.330 --> 43:34.440
I'll be in front of your house in 30 minutes.

43:34.839 --> 43:36.069
Can we meet for a moment?

43:36.469 --> 43:37.810
I'll wait until you come out.

44:12.940 --> 44:14.009
Hi.

44:18.110 --> 44:19.179
Where are you going?

44:21.049 --> 44:25.250
Why did you not come to watch our performance today?

44:26.589 --> 44:27.819
I was waiting.

44:33.600 --> 44:34.799
I'm deaf.

44:35.659 --> 44:36.699
I know.

44:37.330 --> 44:38.500
I can't hear anything.

44:39.469 --> 44:40.900
I know.

44:42.869 --> 44:44.810
Why did you invite me then?

44:45.610 --> 44:48.040
Invite? Why did I invite you?

44:49.040 --> 44:50.779
- Of course, that's...
- To mock me?

44:51.049 --> 44:52.579
To make me a spectacle?

44:52.580 --> 44:53.880
- Because you pitied me?
- What?

44:54.179 --> 44:56.480
To show that you have a friend with disabilities and look nice?

44:57.219 --> 44:59.048
"You're bad. But we're having fun like this."

44:59.049 --> 45:00.319
Did you want to brag like this?

45:00.790 --> 45:01.989
Wait. It's too fast.

45:03.830 --> 45:04.860
Hold on.

45:11.500 --> 45:12.529
Oh.

45:16.940 --> 45:20.239
Music isn't something you listen to just by ear.

45:22.509 --> 45:25.009
Music is something you can feel with your eyes,

45:25.850 --> 45:26.920
mind,

45:27.650 --> 45:29.850
and heart.

45:32.949 --> 45:34.318
Don't try to act cool.

45:34.319 --> 45:35.389
It disgusts me.

45:38.630 --> 45:39.730
You're done, right?

45:43.500 --> 45:45.000
Then why did you help our band...

45:46.429 --> 45:47.469
No.

45:50.569 --> 45:51.969
Why did you help me all this time?

45:57.080 --> 45:59.610
Why did you want to be friends?

46:05.489 --> 46:06.520
Why...

46:09.119 --> 46:10.190
did you say...

46:11.589 --> 46:12.860
you liked me?

46:52.170 --> 46:53.699
I guess I'm not invisible anymore.

47:00.940 --> 47:03.110
What am I doing in front of your house?

47:05.250 --> 47:06.408
I've been worrying...

47:06.409 --> 47:08.480
why you rushed out of the auditorium in the middle of the show.

47:10.150 --> 47:12.920
And I've been trying to figure out a way to get you to forgive me.

47:17.159 --> 47:19.130
I think I just found a solution for my second problem.

47:21.600 --> 47:22.929
My biggest worry was...

47:24.230 --> 47:25.630
figuring out how I was going to apologize...

47:26.799 --> 47:28.739
to get your forgiveness.

47:30.869 --> 47:33.710
I've been thinking, and this is the best way.

47:37.980 --> 47:38.980
I'm sorry.

47:41.020 --> 47:42.080
It's my fault.

47:44.020 --> 47:45.089
Please forgive me.

47:48.790 --> 47:50.589
Should I tell you what I did wrong?

47:51.029 --> 47:52.060
I'm sorry.

47:54.960 --> 47:56.330
I was mistaken.

48:00.969 --> 48:03.099
You looked down on me, loathed me, and expressed hatred against me.

48:03.100 --> 48:04.770
You pulled the trifecta while treating me as if I was invisible.

48:05.810 --> 48:06.810
Did you change your tactics?

48:06.811 --> 48:08.040
Are you apologizing as if we've never met?

48:09.339 --> 48:11.279
Anyway, I'm sorry.

48:11.679 --> 48:13.480
You'll never see me again.

48:13.850 --> 48:14.850
Bye.

48:17.449 --> 48:19.218
Hey, I'm apologizing from the bottom of my heart.

48:19.219 --> 48:20.360
Please!

48:22.389 --> 48:24.360
Can't you just leave me alone?

48:25.730 --> 48:28.330
I have so much on my mind that my brain is going to explode.

48:29.259 --> 48:31.368
I can't even begin to think how I wasted my time and energy.

48:31.369 --> 48:32.669
There's no way of knowing...

48:32.670 --> 48:34.138
what I found out is the truth...

48:34.139 --> 48:36.440
or a misunderstanding. This is driving me crazy.

48:37.540 --> 48:39.440
So I'm asking you not to complicate this further.

48:41.880 --> 48:43.040
Did something happen?

48:44.049 --> 48:45.080
No.

48:45.980 --> 48:47.949
Even if it did, it's none of your business.

48:48.520 --> 48:49.548
Hey, Choi Se Gyeong.

48:49.549 --> 48:51.949
I won't pick anyone. Are you happy now?

48:52.920 --> 48:55.659
I'll choose neither you nor Yi Chan.

48:55.889 --> 48:57.258
That's why you're here.

48:57.259 --> 48:58.729
You're worried that I might choose Yi Chan.

48:58.730 --> 49:00.699
Why are you turning me into a bad guy?

49:01.230 --> 49:03.158
I came because I was worried about you.

49:03.159 --> 49:04.529
Don't worry about me!

49:05.529 --> 49:07.798
You and I will never have to see each other again.

49:07.799 --> 49:09.369
You and I are...

49:11.139 --> 49:13.239
from two different worlds, to begin with.

49:24.819 --> 49:26.049
I'm going to check.

49:28.259 --> 49:30.060
I'm going to meet them in person and check.

50:24.080 --> 50:25.150
Hello.

50:34.060 --> 50:36.489
(Used Musical Instruments)

50:40.029 --> 50:42.560
(White Night)

51:00.009 --> 51:01.049
Here.

51:45.889 --> 51:46.989
What are you doing here alone?

51:48.100 --> 51:49.159
I just...

51:50.199 --> 51:51.369
liked the song.

51:53.969 --> 51:55.699
This is a perfect song to seduce women with.

52:10.790 --> 52:11.790
So you've tried that.

52:12.319 --> 52:13.889
Gosh, no way.

52:14.520 --> 52:16.989
This song is about a father who lost his son.

52:17.089 --> 52:19.259
I wouldn't sing this song just to seduce women.

52:27.569 --> 52:28.900
Don't jump to conclusions.

52:29.900 --> 52:31.439
I don't know if I'll have good fortune,

52:31.440 --> 52:32.940
but from the looks of it, I don't have any children.

52:36.880 --> 52:38.779
(White Night)

52:41.020 --> 52:42.049
Ask me.

52:43.279 --> 52:44.350
Ask you what?

52:44.489 --> 52:45.919
Ask your face what.

52:45.920 --> 52:47.520
It's full of question marks.

52:47.920 --> 52:49.159
I'm all ears. Ask me.

52:51.529 --> 52:53.790
Of course, it's probably about your friend, not you.

52:55.159 --> 52:57.299
I had a mission to complete.

52:58.670 --> 53:00.969
I had to fulfill the mission even if I had to risk my life.

53:01.139 --> 53:03.539
Did I say that I could never guarantee...

53:03.540 --> 53:04.940
a wise solution?

53:05.270 --> 53:06.968
I had to get chosen by a girl...

53:06.969 --> 53:09.110
who was so out of my league. That was the mission.

53:09.679 --> 53:12.379
It looked as if she was going to choose the other guy.

53:12.380 --> 53:13.650
So it was really tough.

53:15.279 --> 53:17.690
- So did you fail the mission?
- No, I completed the mission.

53:18.549 --> 53:19.589
No.

53:20.319 --> 53:22.219
It just happened that way.

53:22.719 --> 53:25.060
What do you mean? Did she choose you over him?

53:25.230 --> 53:28.158
No. She said she wasn't going to choose anyone.

53:28.159 --> 53:31.100
Gosh. That's strange.

53:31.429 --> 53:32.500
It is, right?

53:33.529 --> 53:36.198
Anyway, you completed the mission,

53:36.199 --> 53:37.469
but you're not happy.

53:39.310 --> 53:40.739
I'm not sure about that.

53:42.310 --> 53:44.209
It feels as if I swallowed something wrong.

53:44.210 --> 53:45.350
It's frustrating.

53:45.909 --> 53:48.679
When I forced myself to swallow it, it stung.

53:49.850 --> 53:50.889
It aches.

53:51.489 --> 53:52.920
- That's love.
- What?

53:54.089 --> 53:57.159
Wait. Don't tell me she's your first love.

53:57.360 --> 53:59.059
Gosh, don't tease me.

53:59.060 --> 54:01.130
She and I can never end up together.

54:02.159 --> 54:04.099
There's no limit to love.

54:04.100 --> 54:05.170
There is.

54:05.569 --> 54:07.670
I can't overcome a 28-year age gap.

54:07.770 --> 54:11.440
Gosh. Oh, my.

54:11.940 --> 54:14.339
A 28-year age gap?

54:15.339 --> 54:16.480
That might be hard.

54:20.509 --> 54:23.480
It's okay. Stuff like that can happen in your youth.

54:25.319 --> 54:27.389
Immaturity can't be an excuse for my actions.

54:27.989 --> 54:30.659
You'll end up writing great lyrics for a song.

54:37.259 --> 54:38.529
What a beautiful moon.

54:41.170 --> 54:43.139
This is the perfect night to get one's heart broken.

54:48.080 --> 54:49.279
The festival is over.

54:50.310 --> 54:51.810
Don't come to see me ever again.

54:52.710 --> 54:56.250
You and I live in different worlds, anyway.

55:39.759 --> 55:41.060
- What's wrong with her?
- I don't know.

55:55.210 --> 55:57.109
Gosh. Seriously.

55:57.110 --> 55:59.509
Se Gyeong has been acting like a different person lately.

55:59.779 --> 56:03.079
It's not like going to the US is as easy as taking the bus downtown.

56:03.080 --> 56:04.619
She treated it as if she was going to a corner shop.

56:04.790 --> 56:06.588
She said, "I'm going to the US. Bye."

56:06.589 --> 56:07.860
How can anyone just do that?

56:10.420 --> 56:12.290
No, I'm being serious right now.

56:12.389 --> 56:15.129
She said she was going to the US right now.

56:15.130 --> 56:17.599
I just talked to her on the phone. Who is this?

56:17.600 --> 56:18.699
What are you talking about?

56:19.569 --> 56:20.698
Where's Se Gyeong going?

56:20.699 --> 56:23.069
You must have a death wish, seriously. Darn it.

56:24.409 --> 56:25.540
The United States!

56:26.940 --> 56:28.310
Don't worry about me!

56:29.239 --> 56:31.508
You and I will never have to see each other again.

56:31.509 --> 56:32.909
You and I are...

56:34.819 --> 56:36.880
from two different worlds, to begin with.

56:51.770 --> 56:53.199
Taxi!

56:56.569 --> 56:58.440
Taxi!

57:02.440 --> 57:03.710
Do you like me?

57:04.980 --> 57:06.279
Be honest with me.

57:07.009 --> 57:11.449
Is it me? Or is it Yi Chan?

57:16.619 --> 57:17.659
Taxi!

57:25.569 --> 57:26.730
I bet you've never dated.

57:27.469 --> 57:29.639
You've never dated, right? I knew it!

57:31.139 --> 57:35.980
Look at you, you've never dated

57:50.520 --> 57:52.960
Taxi!

57:54.130 --> 57:55.199
Taxi!

58:06.839 --> 58:09.480
(Entrance)

58:17.319 --> 58:18.719
You can't go in there!

58:34.100 --> 58:35.239
(Gimpo International Airport)

58:40.009 --> 58:42.380
(International Departures)

58:42.710 --> 58:44.980
(International Departures)

59:20.549 --> 59:23.650
Why are you crying here all alone? You're breaking my heart.

59:25.650 --> 59:27.719
I don't know how to go back.

59:30.520 --> 59:33.089
I need to check some things with my parents.

59:34.529 --> 59:36.060
I have questions for them too.

59:37.330 --> 59:40.330
I thought I would be able to go back as easily as I came here.

59:42.369 --> 59:44.069
But I can't find my way back.

59:45.940 --> 59:48.339
I even thought about not going back.

59:50.580 --> 59:52.310
But now, I can't go back even if I wanted.

59:53.150 --> 59:54.179
What should I do?

59:55.049 --> 59:57.350
What if I can't go back for the rest of my life?

59:58.850 --> 01:00:00.089
I'll help you.

01:00:01.589 --> 01:00:02.659
How?

01:00:03.319 --> 01:00:04.389
How can you help me?

01:00:04.759 --> 01:00:06.059
I'll make it work.

01:00:06.060 --> 01:00:09.230
I'll do whatever it takes to help you find your way back.

01:00:11.100 --> 01:00:12.799
But stay here with me for now.

01:00:18.969 --> 01:00:20.239
Stay with me.

01:00:41.060 --> 01:00:43.730
You said we were from two different worlds, right?

01:00:45.400 --> 01:00:46.469
But I don't care.

01:00:52.670 --> 01:00:54.940
I don't care if you're a middle-aged woman.

01:00:56.839 --> 01:00:58.509
I don't care if you turn out to be a zombie.

01:01:01.650 --> 01:01:03.980
That's why we should...

01:01:05.219 --> 01:01:06.420
stay together.

01:02:04.040 --> 01:02:07.480
It looks like you finally found your helper.

01:02:11.719 --> 01:02:14.319
I hope it wasn't too late, though.

01:02:29.869 --> 01:02:32.770
(Special thanks to Park Ho San and Ryu Jin)

01:03:00.029 --> 01:03:04.838
(Twinkling Watermelon)

01:03:04.839 --> 01:03:07.508
How are we going to write a song in a month?

01:03:07.509 --> 01:03:09.309
How about a one-day song retreat?

01:03:09.310 --> 01:03:10.908
We can decide on the theme of our song.

01:03:10.909 --> 01:03:12.079
We can bond as a band too.

01:03:12.080 --> 01:03:14.979
Your trip is nearing its end now.

01:03:14.980 --> 01:03:17.719
When we met by chance, I liked that you were honest.

01:03:17.850 --> 01:03:21.088
That's really me! I'm serious!

01:03:21.089 --> 01:03:22.158
What about Yoon Chung Ah?

01:03:22.159 --> 01:03:23.218
You didn't care that she didn't come to the festival.

01:03:23.219 --> 01:03:25.028
You don't seem concerned that she's not coming to the retreat.

01:03:25.029 --> 01:03:26.929
What's your problem?

01:03:27.130 --> 01:03:29.529
When your life can twinkle again on its own,

01:03:29.929 --> 01:03:32.029
I hope it twinkles as radiantly as possible...

01:03:32.600 --> 01:03:34.670
because I don't have much time left with me.

01:03:35.300 --> 01:03:37.000
Dramaday.me
